  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Advocate Development Program: To build the capacity of SVSG youth leaders to provide valuable services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BHC Apia will provide funding for the training and development of SVSG youth leaders, assisting in building their capacity to advocate for and instigate valuable changes in their communities.

Objective 1: To train 10 youth leaders registered with the SVSG Youth as trainers of the young offenders rehabilitative counselling program.

Objective 2: To mobilize youth during the Commonwealth Youth Forum to advocate for changes in youth behaviour towards addressing violence and supporting vulnerable youth.</narrative>
  </description>
